 ### Slice 7DGS to Conditional 3DGS
-This is the core algorithmic procedure described in the main method. It refers to the specific implementation of partitioning the 7D covariance and computing the conditional 3D Gaussian statistics. It is chosen when one needs to render a specific frame at time $t$ from direction $d$ using the 7DGS representation. It is distinct from static slicing because it includes the adaptive refinement step before conditioning [S1].
